{
    "title": "Build A Car : Racing Game",
    "description": "\ud83c\udfce\ufe0f Build A Car\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd25 Get ready for the ultimate racing experience! Race, customize, and dominate the drag strip in \"Build A Car\" \u2013 the adrenaline-fueled mobile game that puts YOU in the driver's seat.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\ude97 Customize Your Ride:\r\nTransform your car into a high-performance beast! Explore the first part of the game as you navigate through doors with powerful upgrades \u2013 engines, spoilers, rims, exhaust, window color, body color, and body coating. Choose wisely, and watch your car evolve into a speed demon!\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf08 Endless Customization:\r\nPersonalize every detail of your ride to perfection. Experiment with combinations to optimize performance and style. Your choices matter \u2013 tune your car right, and leave your rivals in the dust!\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfc1 Drag Racing Mastery:\r\nGear up for heart-pounding drag races in the second part of the game. Test your tapping skills in a classic drag race scenario. Perfect timing is the key to victory! Tap to shift gears at the right moment and leave your opponents eating your dust. Do not forget to use your Nitro to boost your performance!\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd27 Upgrade and Dominate:\r\nEarn rewards from victorious races and use them to upgrade your car further. Fine-tune your engine, enhance aerodynamics, and boost your acceleration. Only the best-tuned cars will rule the streets!\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf1f Key Features:\r\n\r\nThrilling drag races\r\nExtensive car customization\r\nStrategic tuning for optimal performance\r\nStunning graphics and realistic physics\r\nCompete against strong AI\r\nRegular updates with new doors and challenges\r\n\ud83d\udea6 Build A Car is more than just a game; it's a lifestyle for true racing enthusiasts. Download now and be the king of the asphalt!",
    "descriptionHTML": "\ud83c\udfce\ufe0f Build A Car<br><br>\ud83d\udd25 Get ready for the ultimate racing experience! Race, customize, and dominate the drag strip in &quot;Build A Car&quot; \u2013 the adrenaline-fueled mobile game that puts YOU in the driver&#39;s seat.<br><br>\ud83d\ude97 Customize Your Ride:<br>Transform your car into a high-performance beast! Explore the first part of the game as you navigate through doors with powerful upgrades \u2013 engines, spoilers, rims, exhaust, window color, body color, and body coating. Choose wisely, and watch your car evolve into a speed demon!<br><br>\ud83c\udf08 Endless Customization:<br>Personalize every detail of your ride to perfection. Experiment with combinations to optimize performance and style. Your choices matter \u2013 tune your car right, and leave your rivals in the dust!<br><br>\ud83c\udfc1 Drag Racing Mastery:<br>Gear up for heart-pounding drag races in the second part of the game. Test your tapping skills in a classic drag race scenario. Perfect timing is the key to victory! Tap to shift gears at the right moment and leave your opponents eating your dust. Do not forget to use your Nitro to boost your performance!<br><br>\ud83d\udd27 Upgrade and Dominate:<br>Earn rewards from victorious races and use them to upgrade your car further. Fine-tune your engine, enhance aerodynamics, and boost your acceleration. Only the best-tuned cars will rule the streets!<br><br>\ud83c\udf1f Key Features:<br><br>Thrilling drag races<br>Extensive car customization<br>Strategic tuning for optimal performance<br>Stunning graphics and realistic physics<br>Compete against strong AI<br>Regular updates with new doors and challenges<br>\ud83d\udea6 Build A Car is more than just a game; it&#39;s a lifestyle for true racing enthusiasts. Download now and be the king of the asphalt!",
